Z||000000||87ECO5||05-04-2001||10:42 PM||||"Hey, man!  Check out this dude - driving one of them stupid Pontiac Fieros!  Ha ha ha ha ha ... he wants to race!  Ah man, he's a sittin' duck!!!  Check it out - it's only got a single exhaust!  Didn't the V6 cars come with duals!?  Hmmm ... sure doesn't sound like a 4 ..."<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fierrari1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fierrari2.jpg"> <P>"HOLY S#!T!!!!!  He took me off the line and he's still pulling away!  What's he got in that b!t@h!?!?!?  It sure does sound good!  I gotta BS with this dude ..."<P>"Hey, man!  What you got in there!?"<P>[me raising the decklid of my '87 economy coupe to reveal its heart]<P>"Man, is that stock!?  It sure does look like it ..."<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fierrari3.jpg"> <P>[me admitting that, though it looks stock, it's a remanufactured 3.4 (bored out to a 3.6) V6]<P>"Damn, dude!  That's hot!  And I like those wheels and tires too!  What are they?"<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fierrari4.jpg"> <P>[me explaining they're Falken FK-451s on 17" Konig Monsoons]<P>.<BR>.<BR>.<P>[me waking up from an awesome dream!!!!!]    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
